	# Worlds with their own housing (0.8.0, Andrzej: "Unique planets should matter"). Keyed by market id. Read from
	# each world's description in the game (descriptions.csv), 2026-11-15. Other mods can add their own worlds.
	#   name      shown in the tooltips next to the effect, like a market condition.
	#   line      one plain line on the agent's screen.
	#   homes     multiplies how many homes the market has room for.
	#   price     multiplies prices, like a market condition (and the location grade).
	#   comfort, happiness, security   added, 0 to 100 scale, like a market condition.
	#   tiers     multiplies how often each home size is listed. 0: never listed here.
	#   traits    multiplies how often each house trait is rolled here (0.8.1): Underground on Sindria's hive
	#             cities, Smoggy on Chicomoztoc. 0: never here. A trait named with 1 or more needs no condition or
	#             climate of its own (the lore is the reason), only its size and planet-or-station rules.
	#             10 or more: every home there has it.
